```Title: Port Forwarding Added with netsh portproxy (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1090.001 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: faaa5a3c-f601-4746-95ba-5608584d8f6d```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Administrators setting up legitimate port forwarding (e.g. WSL or lab access)```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
